    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a normal kind of pain though. it's more like... i'm just exhausted. like there's nothing left in me to even try to \"navigate\" anything. i look at his side of the bed and it’s just so much easier to imagine him being there than to face being here without him. i just want the weight to stop. i want to stop feeling everything.",
