      "content": "i know about the numbers. a hotline doesn't change the fact that he's not coming back. it just feels like i'm stuck in this waiting room for nothing. sometimes i think the only way i'll ever actually find peace or see him again is if i just... stop. if i just let go. does that even make sense? like, why is staying here when everything is gone supposed to be the right thing?",
